{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Seek to rejoin the Single Market and EFTA",
        "additional_details": "Under this arrangement the UK could keep the pound sterling and maintain sovereignty. We believe this option would respect the 2016 Brexit vote but foster UK-EU trade and friendship.",
        "background": "We call upon the Government to seek to rejoin the Single Market (European Economic Area) and European Free Trade Association (EFTA). We think this would be a substantial boost to the UK economy & provide reassurance and safeguards to UK citizens living & working in Europe.",
